<p>I really dig this. Maybe I was less &quot;scared&quot; and more &quot;very, very interested&quot;, especially during the model train bit. Of course, I much prefer to be interested anyways.</p>
<p>EDIT: Another thought I had.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
