<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Magnetic objects can induce temporary magnetism in nearby objects. This is why you can make a magnetized chain of paper clips when only one clip in the chain is in contact with a magnet: the field of the magnet temporarily aligns the molecules of the paper clips to create a magnetic effect.</p>
<p>So, if a planet has a soul, and is producing a soul field&#8230; and other celestial bodies have started to exhibit similar fields&#8230;</p>
<p>The Foundation may have a bigger problem on their hands than they realize.</p>
