<p>I'm afraid this couldn't hold my interest.</p>
<p>Also, probably because I limit the javascript on my computer, but there was no countdown on mine. I had to check the page source to get the idea of what was supposed to be going on, and the answer wasn't supposed to be hiding in the page source.</p>
<p>And finally, I agree, a mental disorder and a couple changes to political norms don't even register on my panel as bad things. We don't even know they are bad things. Would we be better off as a species and a people without them? We honestly don't know and so anyone with an opinion one way or another is suspect, to me, without lots of evidence to back the argument up.</p>
<p>The widespread use of the Soul Extractor, that's another story, but that's related to <a href="/scp-158">SCP-158</a> and not to this. Then again, even that horror was mitigated to the hilarity of the enterprising use of a corpse as a drill bit.</p>
